+
+# hive uninstall
+
+1. Stop + unregister daemon service
+2. Channel-aware binary removal (instruct brew/aur; delete bash files under `~/.local`)
+3. Prompt before removing global config (default No); `--purge` skips prompts but **still preserves** state and project work
+4. Never deletes per-project `.hive-state/` / worktrees by default
+5. Skills are marketplace-managed — not removed here
+
+```bash
+hive uninstall
+hive uninstall --purge
+```
+
