+# Hive::Service
+
+**TLDR**: Registers the hive daemon as a launchd agent (macOS) or `systemd --user` unit (Linux). Never silent-autostart — `hive init` prompts; non-TTY registers disabled.
+
+Templates: `templates/service/hive-daemon.plist.erb`, `templates/service/hive-daemon.service.erb`.
+
+Logs under `Hive::Paths.state_dir/daemon/`. When `systemctl --user` is unavailable (containers/WSL2), init skips registration quietly; operators use `hive daemon start --detach`.
+
